# Pin LF line endings on every checkout, including Windows.
# Round 81: the suite reads repo files and compares their content
# (docs cross-references, SKILL.md code blocks, fixture text).
# A CRLF checkout on Windows would put a trailing \r on every
# line those comparisons see. LF is also what the source itself
# assumes. This does not change any file's content on Linux.
* text=auto eol=lf
